{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1012520001:1":{"text":"미샤르테가 보우하사, 무사히 돌아오셨군요. 그 몬스터들은 아직 숲 은신처 마을에 있나요?","source_cn":"弥萨忒保佑，你们平安回来了，那些魔物还在林隐村吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DB76EEE60A52754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1012520001":{"text":"미샤르테가 보우하사, 무사히 돌아오셨군요. 그 몬스터들은 아직 숲 은신처 마을에 있나요?","source_cn":"弥萨忒保佑，你们平安回来了，那些魔物还在林隐村吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DB76EEE60A52754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012520002:1":{"text":"여러분에게 꼭 보답하겠습니다... 하지만 그 전에 제 아들을 먼저...","source_cn":"我一定会好好感激你们的……但在这之前，我得去找到我的儿子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5385E7A861FA9E5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012520003:1":{"text":"그건 너무 위험해요. 보통 사람이 상대할 수 있는 게 아니에요.","source_cn":"那太危险了，前面不是普通人可以应付的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12274D35F242F3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012520004:1":{"text":"저도 봤어요... 물론 그 몬스터들이 무섭다는 건 알지만 계속 숨어 있을 수는 없어요...","source_cn":"我见过……我当然见过那些魔物的可怕，但我不能继续躲着了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFADFE56CA02C40A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012520005:1":{"text":"누나 말이 맞아요. 그러면 희생만 더 늘어날 거예요.","source_cn":"姐说得对，那样只会多一个人遇害而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA3AB97B7F6EDCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012520006:1":{"text":"여러분의 호의는 알겠지만... 전 일반 주민이 아니라 촌장입니다.... 마을을 위해 죽을 각오가 되어 있어야 했지만 도망치고 말았죠.","source_cn":"明白你们的好意……但我不是普通人……我是村长，本来我随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4328BF32850236D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012520007:1":{"text":"전 아들을 꼭 구해야 합니다. 아들조차 지키지 못한다면 그게 무슨 촌장인가요?","source_cn":"我必须救回我的儿子，如果我连他都不能保护，还当什么村长呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA527085C34AC8D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012520008:1":{"text":"전 이 문제를 직면해야 합니다. 전 이제 아무것도 두렵지 않아요!","source_cn":"我必须面对这件事，对，我现在什么都不怕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x493C1E074A918EB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012520009:1":{"text":"음... 진심인가요? 여기 남아서 우리를 기다리는 게 더 안전할 것 같은데...","source_cn":"呃……你是认真的吗？我觉得你留在这里等我们更安全……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1980E903A5819BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012520010:1":{"text":"전 그가 합류하는 데 동의합니다. 어떠신가요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.","source_cn":"我同意让他加入，不知你意下如何？<style=stre...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A91E45415852EA6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전 그가 합류하는 데 동의합니다. 어떠신가요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.","female":"전 그가 합류하는 데 동의합니다. 어떠신가요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.","variant_male_record_index":"110305","variant_female_record_index":"110306","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1012520010":{"text":"전 그가 합류하는 데 동의합니다. 어떠신가요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.","source_cn":"我同意让他加入，不知你意下如何？<style=stress><player_name></style>。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A91E45415852EA6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전 그가 합류하는 데 동의합니다. 어떠신가요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.","female":"전 그가 합류하는 데 동의합니다. 어떠신가요? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님.","variant_male_record_index":"110305","variant_female_record_index":"110306","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012520011:1":{"text":"멀린 님까지... 다들 진심이에요?","source_cn":"连梅林大人也……你们都是认真的吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0A36EFBD704443E7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님까지... 다들 진심이에요?","female":"멀린 님까지... 다들 진심이에요?","variant_male_record_index":"110307","variant_female_record_index":"110308","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012520012:1":{"text":"두려움과 맞바꾼 용기는 고결한 법이야. 그 용기를 짓밟고 싶진 않아.","source_cn":"恐惧换来的勇气很高尚，我不想践踏这份勇气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47CAAB26160BEABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012520013:1":{"text":"고마워요, 모두 고마워요...","source_cn":"感谢，感谢你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3A58CC6083450D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"합류시키고 무기를 나눠줘","source_cn":"让他加入，分给他一把武器","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x498224F064EBAD90","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"합류시키고 무기를 나눠줘","female":"합류시키고 무기를 나눠줘","variant_male_record_index":"61128","variant_female_record_index":"61129","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"이미 제거됐어","source_cn":"已经被清理了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A5D2ADACFA9A559","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이미 제거됐어","female":"이미 제거됐어","variant_male_record_index":"61126","variant_female_record_index":"61127","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村长伊凡":{"text":"촌장 이반","source":"村长伊凡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":4}}